Count: 21/21 hooks ported (16 reads + 5 mutations; the prompt's "15 reads + 6 mutations" split counts
the useExportJobs GET under mutations). Reads emit cache->network (ADR-013 Resource). Mutations are
non-throwing Result; on success each refreshes exactly the feeds the matching web hook invalidates.
No direct Ktor in the holder — it delegates entirely to the injected AdminRepository (S7), which evicts
the affected cache keys so a refresh re-fetches rather than replaying a stale entry. SI is preserved
end-to-end; there is no unit-bearing conversion in this domain.

